From 0d025d8d8d00da992321087ad458e3ff6eead512 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenCode Agent <opencode@localhost>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] feat(github): add manual app registration endpoint

Adds POST /api/v1/workspaces/{workspace_id}/github/manual-registration
for manually registering a GitHub App when the manifest flow is not
available (e.g., personal accounts on GHES that don't support manifest
creation).

The endpoint accepts:
- app_id: GitHub App ID
- slug: GitHub App slug (URL-friendly name)
- private_key: PEM-formatted private key
- webhook_secret: Webhook secret configured in GitHub

This bypasses the manifest flow while still using Orbit's internal
encryption and validation.
